{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-pro-18-1","title":"Proverbs 18:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>or, He that separateth himself seeketh, according to his desire and intermeddleth in every business.</p>\n<p>Ex 33:16; Zec 7:3; Ro 1:1; 2Co 6:17; Jude 1:19 seeketh. 2:1-6; Mt 13:11,44; Mr 4:11; Eph 5:15-17 intermeddleth. 14:10; 17:14; 20:3,19; 24:21; 26:17; Isa 26:8,9; Jer 15:17; Mr 1:35</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-18-2","title":"Proverbs 18:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>fool. 1:7,22; 17:16; Ps 1:1,2; Mt 8:34; 1Co 8:1 but. Nu 24:15,16; 1Co 14:12; Php 1:15; 2Pe 2:15-19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-18-3","title":"Proverbs 18:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>11:2; 22:10; 29:16; 1Sa 20:30; Ne 4:4; Ps 69:9,20; 123:3,4 Mt 27:39-44; 1Pe 4:4,14</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-18-4","title":"Proverbs 18:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>words. 10:11; 13:14; 16:22; 20:5; Mt 12:34; Joh 4:14; 7:38,39; Col 3:16; 4:6 the wellspring. Ps 78:2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-18-5","title":"Proverbs 18:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>not. 24:23; 28:21; Le 19:15; De 1:16,17; 16:19; Job 13:7,8; 34:19 Mt 22:16 to overthrow. 1Ki 21:9-14; Isa 5:23; 59:14; Mic 7:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-18-6","title":"Proverbs 18:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>fools. 12:16; 13:10; 14:16; 16:27,28; 17:14; 20:3; 27:3 his. 14:3; 19:19; 22:24,25; 25:24; 29:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-18-7","title":"Proverbs 18:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>his destruction. 10:8,14; 12:13; 13:3; Ec 10:11-14 his lips. 6:2; Jud 11:35; 1Sa 14:24-46; Mr 6:23-28; Ac 23:14-22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-18-8","title":"Proverbs 18:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>words. 12:18; 16:28; 26:20-22; Le 19:16; Ps 52:2; 64:3,4 tale-bearer. or, whisperer. as wounds. or, like as whenmen are wounded. innermost parts. Heb. chambers.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-18-9","title":"Proverbs 18:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>that is slothful. 10:4; 23:20,21; 24:30-34; Mt 25:26; Ro 12:11; Heb 6:12 is brother. 28:24; Job 30:29; Lu 15:13,14; 16:1,2</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-18-10","title":"Proverbs 18:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>name. Ge 17:1; Ex 3:13-15; 6:3; 34:5-7; Isa 9:6; 57:15; Jer 23:6; Mt 1:23 Re 1:8 a strong. 2Sa 22:3,51; Ps 18:2; 27:1; 61:3,4; 91:2; 144:2; Isa 26:4 the righteous. Ge 32:11,28,29; 1Sa 30:6; 2Sa 22:45-47; Ps 56:3,4 safe. Heb. set aloft. Ps 91:14; Hab 3:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-18-11","title":"Proverbs 18:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>10:15; 11:4; De 32:31; Job 31:24,25; Ps 49:6-9; 52:5-7; 62:10,11 Ec 7:12; Lu 12:19-21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-18-12","title":"Proverbs 18:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>destruction. 11:2; 16:18; 29:23; Eze 16:49,50; 28:2,9; Da 5:23,24; Ac 12:21-23 and. 15:33; Job 42:6-17; Isa 6:5-13; Da 9:20,23; Lu 14:11; 1Pe 5:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-18-13","title":"Proverbs 18:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>that. De 13:14; 2Sa 16:4; 19:24-30; Es 3:10-15; 8:5-17; Job 29:16 Da 6:9,14; Joh 7:51 answereth a matter. Heb. returneth a word.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-18-14","title":"Proverbs 18:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>spirit. Job 1:20,21; 2:7-10; Ps 147:3; Ro 5:3-5; 8:35-37; 2Co 1:12; 12:9,10 Jas 1:2; 1Pe 1:6 but. 17:22; Job 6:4; 7:14,15; 10:15-17; Ps 30:9,10; 32:3,4; 38:2-4 Ps 42:10,11; 55:3,5; 77:2,3; 88:14-16; 109:22; Mr 14:33,34; 2Co 2:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-18-15","title":"Proverbs 18:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>1:5; 4:5,7; 9:9; 10:14; 15:14; 23:23; 1Ki 3:9; Ps 119:97-104 Lu 8:8-10; 10:39; 2Ti 3:15-17; Jas 1:5</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-18-16","title":"Proverbs 18:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>17:8; 19:6; 21:14; Ge 32:20; 33:10; 43:11; 1Sa 25:27</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-18-17","title":"Proverbs 18:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>13; 2Sa 16:1-3; 19:24-27; Ac 24:5,6,12,13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-18-18","title":"Proverbs 18:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>16:33; Jos 14:2; 1Sa 10:21-27; 14:42; 1Ch 6:63; 24:31; Ne 11:1</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-18-19","title":"Proverbs 18:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>brother. 6:19; Ge 4:5-8; 27:41-45; 32:6-11; 37:3-5,11,18-27; 2Sa 13:22,28 1Ki 2:23-25; 12:16; 2Ch 13:17; Ac 15:39 than. 16:32</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-18-20","title":"Proverbs 18:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>12:13,14; 13:2; 22:18,21; 25:11,12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-18-21","title":"Proverbs 18:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>Death. 4-7; 10:20,21,31; 11:30; Mt 12:35-37; Ro 10:14,15; 2Co 2:16; 11:15 Eph 4:29; Col 4:6; Tit 1:10,11; Jas 3:6-9; 2Pe 2:18 and. 10:19; Ec 10:12-14; Isa 57:19</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-18-22","title":"Proverbs 18:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>findeth a wife. 5:15-23; 12:4; 19:14; 31:10-31; Ge 24:67; 29:20,21,28; Ec 9:9 Ho 12:12; 1Co 7:2 and. 3:4; 8:35</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-18-23","title":"Proverbs 18:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>poor. Ru 2:7; 1Sa 2:36; 2Ki 4:1,2; Isa 66:2; Mt 5:3; Jas 1:9-11 rich. Ge 42:7,30; Ex 5:2; 1Sa 25:10,17; Jas 2:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-18-24","title":"Proverbs 18:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":18,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":18,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>that hath. 17:17; 27:9; 1Sa 19:4,5; 30:26-31; 2Sa 9:1-13; 16:17; 17:27-29 2Sa 19:30-39; 21:7; 1Ch 12:38-40; Mt 26:49,50 there. 2Sa 1:26; Joh 15:14,15</p>"}]}